    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit back, relax, and watch your train do the heavy lifting as it gathers resources to help you craft new tracks and expand your railway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lazy Train Game</i> offers a short and calming yet rewarding experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need to speed things up? Use the game\u2019s speed control to breeze through milestones and keep the momentum rolling. Perfect for a laid-back gaming session or a quick escape into a world of tracks and trains!</p>",
